    {
      "source": "Interface definition for structures defined in <a href=\"https://geojson.org\">GeoJSON</a>\nformat. copied from Spring Data Mongodb",
      "translation": "<a href=\"https://geojson.org\">GeoJSON</a> 格式中定义的结构的接口定义。从 Spring Data MongoDB 复制而来。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"GeoJson.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.geo\"><code>GeoJson</code></a> representation of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Point</code></a>.<br/>\nCopied from Spring Data Mongodb, not derived from <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Point</code></a> as this conflicts with the already existing converter\nfor Point in <a href=\"../convert/GeoConverters.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.convert\"><code>GeoConverters</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"GeoJson.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.geo 中的接口\"><code>GeoJson</code></a> 表示 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.geo 中的类或接口\"><code>Point</code></a>。<br/>\n此内容是从 Spring Data MongoDB 复制而来，而非从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.geo 中的类或接口\"><code>Point</code></a> 派生，因为这与 <a href=\"../convert/GeoConverters.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.convert 中的类\"><code>GeoConverters</code></a> 中已存在的 Point 转换器存在冲突。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Defines a <a href=\"GeoJsonGeometryCollection.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.geo\"><code>GeoJsonGeometryCollection</code></a> that consists of a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> of <a href=\"GeoJson.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.geo\"><code>GeoJson</code></a> objects.<br/>\nCopied from Spring Data Mongodb",
      "translation": "定义了一个<a href=\"GeoJsonGeometryCollection.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.geo\"><code>GeoJsonGeometryCollection</code></a>，它由一个包含<a href=\"GeoJson.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.elasticsearch.core.geo\"><code>GeoJson</code></a>对象的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>组成。<br/>\n从 Spring Data MongoDB 复制而来",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
